OL,3,GNEWSABattery storage system could power
OL,4,A170,000 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a battery storage system
OL,7,Fcapable of powering more than 170,000
OL,8,Fhomes have been recommended for
OL,9,Fapproval.
OL,11,FCONNECTID 2 Ltd has applied to install
OL,12,Fthe infrastructure on land west of the
OL,13,FA140 at Red House Farm in Yaxley, near
OL,14,FEye, Suffolk.
OL,16,FHowever, the application has been
OL,17,Fopposed by Yaxley, Thrandeston and
OL,18,FMellis parish councils over concerns
OL,19,Fincluding flooding and fire safety.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
